{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:36:33+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:36:33+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Atresmedia Corporación de Medios de Comunicación, S.A.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","country":"Spain","city":"Madrid","website":"https://www.atresmediacorporacion.com","employees":2595,"summary":"Atresmedia Corporación de Medios de Comunicación, S.A., an audiovisual company, engages in the television, radio, digital and multimedia development, cinema, and events organization businesses in Spain and internationally. It is involved in the creation, production, distribution, dissemination, and marketing of audiovisual content; management of copyright and music rights; development and exploitation of digital content; and local digital terrestrial television business. The company also operates Atresplayer, a video on demand platform; and under the Antena 3, La Sexta, Onda Cero, and Europa FM, as well as Mega and Atreseries, and Melodía FM brands. In addition, it is involved in the provision of travel agency, marketing and advertising, TV management, advertising management, broadcasting, computer, and funeral services; and document management services for audiovisual products. The company was formerly known as Antena 3 de Televisión, S.A. Atresmedia Corporación de Medios de Comunicación, S.A. was incorporated in 1988 and is based in Madrid, Spain.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Atresmedia Corporacin de Medios de Comunicacin, S.A., une société audiovisuelle, s'engage dans les activités de télévision, de radio, de développement numérique et multimédia, de cinéma et d'organisation d'événements en Espagne et à l'étranger. Elle participe à la création, à la production, à la distribution, à la diffusion et à la commercialisation de contenus audiovisuels, à la gestion du droit d